Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.52,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Breathe it in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽情感受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:08.19,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一局就失守
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他还是把北京的不败纪录
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:12.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}带到了{\fs78}32{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}4{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:17.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}中网男单{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:21.75,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Out it goes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:27.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is Alexander Zverev, who wastes very little time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫很快抓住了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:29.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约开场就被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫世界第{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}要把首盘抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:35.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}每一次接发 都得重新去争
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:45.69,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, yes! Exquisite!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球！太精妙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:48.82,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}比分在追 局面还没有追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:53.75,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Gets him!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他得手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:55.93,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, Djokovic!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 德约科维奇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:00:58.59,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘的拉锯还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:00.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}双方都把回球送向边线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:02.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}让对手继续跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:03.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}每一次逼近机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:06.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}都得先顶住这样的相持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:27.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh! Alexander Zverev!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦！亚历山大 兹维列夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:31.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 德约救下盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:33.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}又追出两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:36.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}救盘点和第一个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.05,0:01:38.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}官方集锦没有完整收录
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:41.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是第二次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:42.85,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}抢回这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:45.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约就能把首盘拉回{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:47.40,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两个人都把场地跑开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:50.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一分 谁也不肯轻易放手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:06.53,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, Djokovic didn't take advantage there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇没能抓住这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:09.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Great hustle from Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫奋力救球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:17.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The set does go the way of our top seed, Alexander Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子兹维列夫拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:20.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 首盘属于兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:21.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘重新开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:24.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约仍得从自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:26.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一分一分争回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:34.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, no way!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 难以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:36.53,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's got it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他打成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:40.17,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is remarkable!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这太不可思议了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:43.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:44.91,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约先救下破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:46.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}再保发到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.69,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一关键点的完整过程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.02,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}官方集锦没有收录
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:55.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}底线的相持 一路打到了前场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:57.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}短球过来 德约向前追
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.61,0:03:01.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这个来之不易的盘点 必须亲手去争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:08.79,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Brilliant!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:13.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a place he loves.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他爱这片场地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:16.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 比赛扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:18.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:20.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}压力又回到德约的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:22.23,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫冲向网前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:24.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约把球送向两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, he was stretching there, Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 兹维列夫奋力伸展开来救球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}险关守住以后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}开场那次失守再没重演
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:43.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}此后的{\fs78}14{\fs68}个发球局 他全部保住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Injecting the extra pace up the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N沿直线打出了更快的球速
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:50.44,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}全场{\fs78}19{\fs68}个{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.55,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}兹维列夫的发球够强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.37,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}德约只完成两次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:56.37,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}却分别收下后两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:03:59.53,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}机会的价值 落在何时抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.39,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}又是{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:03.89,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约拿到第一个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可 兹维列夫还在顶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.11,0:04:09.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}比赛还没结束 逐分争夺仍要继续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:40.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一个赛点 被兹维列夫救回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.43,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约还得再争一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:47.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't think anybody breathing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我觉得大家都屏住了呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:51.78,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫又拿到局点 德约再追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:54.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二个赛点 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it again!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他又做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:01.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N诺瓦克 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:06.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's something about this place.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这片场地有些特别之处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:11.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there is something about this man.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而这个人也有些特别之处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:15.59,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The unbeaten record here in Beijing continues.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在北京的不败纪录仍在延续
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Breathe it in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽情感受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:27.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}张开双臂 留住这一晚的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一轮对梅总
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:32.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约还能把北京的不败纪录延续吗？
